{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20229","headline":"峡哀 五 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡螭老解语，百丈潭底闻。\n毒波爲计校，饮血养子孙。\n既非臯陶吏，空食沈狱魂。\n潜怪何幽幽，魄说徒云云。\n峡听哀哭泉，峡吊鳏寡猿。\n峡声非人声，劒水相劈翻。\n斯谁士诸谢，奏此沉苦言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}